# #5833, review B1. foreignHigh counts PreArm appends only: an earlier activation that
# armed appended stamped records, and the next activation arms past them. It edits an
# operator, not an action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestForeignHighIgnoresEarlierStampedEpoch
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: foreignHigh counts PreArm appends only, not an earlier armed activation's stamped ones

--- FIND
    Max({startHead - 1, evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] \in Acts \ {a}}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: stamped appends are not counted.
    Max({startHead - 1, evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ o \in preArm /\ author[o] \in Acts \ {a}}
--- END
